---
description: Architecture & Principles
alwaysApply: false
---
# Applies: Planning, Code Generation

- KISS first.
- YAGNI for speculative features.
- DRY: single authoritative place for logic; extract utilities.
- SOLID focus:
  - Single Responsibility for modules/classes/functions.
  - Open/Closed via composition/configuration.
  - Dependency Inversion to abstractions.
- Fail Fast with upfront validation.

Recommended layout:
src/project/
  __init__.py
  main.py
  tests/test_main.py
  conftest.py
  database/
    __init__.py
    connection.py
    models.py
    tests/
      test_connection.py
      test_models.py
  features/
    user_management/
      __init__.py
      handlers.py
      validators.py
      tests/
        test_handlers.py
        test_validators.py
